        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1150, 8 Inch Offset Door Pull with 3/4 Inch Diameter Grip</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 8 inch Center to Center (CTC) commercial offset door pull is made from 3/4 inch diameter solid round bar stock. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with mounting hardware. Choose between thru-bolt, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-1150-specifications.gif?v=1704442283\" width=\"600\" height=\"174\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1157 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/8-inch-offset-door-pull-don-jo-1156\"><b>8\" Offset Door Pull with 1\" Inch Diameter Grip</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of 3 different materials in 5 finish choices.<br>\r\n*Solid Aluminum: Clear Anodized Aluminum or Duro (Dark Bronze).<br>\r\n*Solid Brass: Polished Brass finish.<br>\r\n*Solid Stainless Steel: Polished Stainless Steel or Satin Stainless Steel finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1157 10\" Offset Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Length Center to Center (CTC): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-1150-specifications.pdf?v=1704262343\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1150 Offset Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
